WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.460
How much time should you plan for
each week?

2
00:00:02.660 --> 00:00:04.663
Here's the honest answer.

3
00:00:04.863 --> 00:00:06.366
Plan for the live coaching

4
00:00:06.366 --> 00:00:08.279
session, then time to put what you

5
00:00:08.279 --> 00:00:10.944
learn into practice, and time to
reflect on it.

6
00:00:11.144 --> 00:00:13.421
That middle part matters most.

7
00:00:13.621 --> 00:00:15.329
This program is built for real

8
00:00:15.329 --> 00:00:17.857
growth, not for watching and
nodding along.

9
00:00:17.857 --> 00:00:20.385
Growth doesn't come from more
information.

10
00:00:20.585 --> 00:00:22.930
It comes from what you do with it.

11
00:00:23.130 --> 00:00:24.770
If you're ready to put in that

12
00:00:24.770 --> 00:00:27.298
time, you'll be amazed at what it
gives back.
